{#
    "From X €/mo. for your whole cart" — hooked into
    `sylius_shop.checkout.common.sidebar.summary`, the order-summary sidebar shared by
    the address, select_shipping, and select_payment steps (see
    @SyliusShop/checkout/common/sidebar/summary.html.twig and
    @SyliusShop/checkout/common/layout.html.twig — the sidebar block is only rendered
    for those three; `complete` overrides it away, which is why that step gets its own
    hook into `sylius_shop.checkout.complete.content.form` instead, see
    rental_overview.html.twig).

    Feedback point: rental prices should stay visible across the whole checkout, not
    just on the payment step — this is the same compact badge already shown on the
    cart page (cart_badge.html.twig), just keyed off `order` instead of `cart` (both
    are OrderInterface; "cart" is simply the not-yet-placed order).
#}
{#
    `mode="cart"` is required — see cart_badge.html.twig for why (the element's own
    `observedAttributes` are `reference`/`mode`; without `mode` it stays empty even
    with `window.topi.cartItems` populated).
#}
{% import '@EilingIoSyliusTopiPlugin/shop/topi_elements/_macros.html.twig' as topi %}
{% set order = hookable_metadata.context.order %}
{% if order is not null %}
    <x-topi-cart-rental-summary-label mode="cart"></x-topi-cart-rental-summary-label>
    {{ topi.cart_item_carriers(order.items) }}
{% endif %}
